"Konstantin, called Kon, is an Anesidoran S-rank Adjuster whose parents are both A-ranks."
"He took a rare path: one skill reads the recent history of nonliving objects."
"His one spell returns objects to a past state, after his skill has read them."
"The System modified his vocal cords for his chants, which sound like a dolphin impression."
"He wants a temporal path and the hero name Kontempus, and calls Alden Bunny Dude."
"His older brother by a year is Lexi."
"He was accepted into the CNH hero track as a Quarter 2 student."
"His parents are Brute ballet dancers with the Anesidoran Avowed Ballet."
"At CNH he rooms with Mehdi in the party room."
"He threw a party at his family's Nilama tower apartment, spending his whole stipend."
"At that party he started going out with Everly Kim."
"His little sister Irina is four and loves turtles."
"He fights with his fists in hero PE and collects people like Easter eggs."
"He joined Lute's class at Nilama Paragon Academy in fifth grade and danced in the youth ballet."
"In the Matadero flood he broke through, casting his spell to drag a whole car back into place."
"The car hit him in the face, knocking out his two front teeth."
